    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«Ser» + participle = action",
     "texto": [
      "With **ser** + participle, you describe the event of the action: **A porta foi fechada pelo porteiro** (the door was closed by the doorman). Here who did it matters."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
